Following are the s3 commands:

Configure aws in CLI:
> aws configure

Test connectivity with AWS:
> aws sts get-caller-identity

List buckets:
> aws s3 ls

Content inside the bucket:
> aws s3 ls s3://asutosh-01052025-test1

Move: s3://asutosh-01052025-test1/Screenshot1.png to s3://asutosh-01052025-test2/Screenshot1.png:
> aws s3 mv s3://asutosh-01052025-test1/Screenshot1.png s3://asutosh-01052025-test2

List all the objects even inside the folders:
> aws s3 ls s3://asutosh-01052025-test2 --recursive


